# Licensed BADA 4 high-lift bank/load REPORT and ENFORCE gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-highlift
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM HIGH-LIFT LATERAL ENVELOPE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO This gate uses PYBADA configuration selection at a previously observed initial-climb state.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT Both aircraft report config IC, nonzero HLid, gear up, DLM nf3/nf1, and bank maximum near 60 degrees.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST ERROR Stop if either aircraft does not expose that high-lift configuration before the turn.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE HLTR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,1500,160
00:00:01.10>CRE HLTE,A320-232,41.32,2.10,90,1500,160
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS HLTR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>DYNAMICS HLTE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG HLTR PYBADA
00:00:01.50>BADACONFIG HLTE PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ALT HLTR FL100 1000
00:00:01.70>ALT HLTE FL100 1000
00:00:01.80>PAN 41.31 2.10
00:00:01.90>ZOOM 20
00:00:02.00>TRAIL ON 0.20
00:00:02.10>TRAIL HLTR RED
00:00:02.20>TRAIL HLTE BLUE
00:00:02.30>BANK HLTR 70
00:00:02.40>BANK HLTE 70
00:00:02.50>ENVELOPECHECKS HLTR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.60>ENVELOPECHECKS HLTE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.70>ENVELOPE HLTR REPORT
00:00:02.80>ENVELOPE HLTE ENFORCE
00:00:02.90>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-highlift.csv
00:00:03.00>PERFSTATUS HLTR BOUNDS
00:00:03.10>PERFSTATUS HLTE BOUNDS
00:00:03.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY event yet because effective bank is zero outside a turn.
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding both aircraft from heading 90 to 270 with a requested 70-degree bank.
00:00:04.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT HLTR REPORT keeps about 70 degrees and coordinated load about 2.924.
00:00:04.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT HLTE ENFORCE limits near 60 degrees and load 2.000.
00:00:04.20>HDG HLTR 270
00:00:04.30>HDG HLTE 270
00:00:08.00>PERFSTATUS HLTR ALL
00:00:08.10>PERFSTATUS HLTE ALL
00:00:08.20>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:08.30>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_highlift_lateral_run.py on output/pybada-envelope-highlift.csv.
00:00:25.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT The red REPORT trail has a tighter radius than the blue ENFORCE trail.
00:00:28.00>HOLD
